==============================================================================
STATUSLINE AND WINBAR			*competitest-statusline-winbar*

When using split UI, windows name can be displayed in statusline or in winbar.
Each CompetiTest buffer defines a local variable `competitest_title`, that is a
string representing window name. You can get its value using
`nvim_buf_get_var(buffer_number, 'competitest_title')`

HIGHLIGHTS				*competitest-highlights*

You can customize CompetiTest highlight groups. Their default values are: >vim
	hi CompetiTestRunning cterm=bold     gui=bold
	hi CompetiTestDone    cterm=none     gui=none
	hi CompetiTestCorrect ctermfg=green  guifg=#00ff00
	hi CompetiTestWarning ctermfg=yellow guifg=orange
	hi CompetiTestWrong   ctermfg=red    guifg=#ff0000
<

